Thank you to Steve Burgess and Halstead Sullivan for sharing with us such fun behind-the-scenes details.
感谢史蒂夫·伯吉斯和霍尔斯特德·沙利文与我们分享了这么多有趣的幕后细节。

1452
01:02:55.340 --> 01:02:56.680
And thank you for all your questions.
也感谢大家提出的所有问题。

1453
01:02:56.680 --> 01:02:59.240
Some great fan catches in this episode.
这一集里粉丝们发现了一些很棒的细节。

1454
01:02:59.360 --> 01:03:00.400
Really good ones.
真的非常精彩。

1455
01:03:00.540 --> 01:03:01.660
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

1456
01:03:01.980 --> 01:03:02.280
Bye.
再见。

